          "text": "Description: On March 28, 2009, at 20:00, an individual observed in the sky (north direction) the passage of a luminous phenomenon. He described a very bright star moving slowly from west to east with a curved trajectory. This witness used binoculars during his observation. No other details were provided by the witness about this phenomenon for which we lack information.",
